{"3911500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slay The King", "steam_appid": 3911500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay The King is an action strategy game where you build an army of warriors to go to war against a corrupt king.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ancient lands have been stolen by a corrupt king. Build your settlements of warriors and defend them against the king's troops. When the time is right, launch your own attack and defeat the king in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.poster.avif?t=1785788319\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.webm?t=1785788319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.mp4?t=1785788319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build catapults, traps and towers to protect your settlements against the king's troops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/2db8e5977cf3ccce55649133a6111d09.poster.avif?t=1785788319\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/2db8e5977cf3ccce55649133a6111d09.webm?t=1785788319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/2db8e5977cf3ccce55649133a6111d09.mp4?t=1785788319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directly command your troops in battle with classic RTS style controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather wood and stone to build your settlements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your warriors with various weapons including axes, bows, spears and shields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level will test your tactical skills and strategic decision making. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slay The King is an action strategy game where you build an army of warriors to go to war against a corrupt king.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ancient lands have been stolen by a corrupt king. Build your settlements of warriors and defend them against the king's troops. When the time is right, launch your own attack and defeat the king in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.poster.avif?t=1785788319\" width=800 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.webm?t=1785788319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911500/extras/ba25dfbdb6c7bcc181898248ea541374.mp4?t=1785788319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build catapults, traps and towers to protect your settlements against the king's troops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c